  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Beyond shared files and collaborative editing, your unit team can keep a shared calendar. Here is how to create one and share it with the team.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Shared calendar (1/3)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In addition to files and collaborative editing, your team can use shared calendars. First, navigate to the <strong>Calendars</strong> menu.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c33adf70d613d1b9.webp",
              "width": 1462,
              "height": 1022
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Shared calendar (2/3)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Create a new calendar and name it appropriately. Then select the <strong>Sharing</strong> menu.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6cf48a40b61289a5.webp",
              "width": 1468,
              "height": 1180
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Shared calendar (3/3)",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Share the calendar with the team. Your team members will then find this shared calendar in their own Calendars menu.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/206f8be3ff9dc2bd.webp",
              "width": 1462,
              "height": 1214
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
